; compiler-expr-1216-pq-a-now-01 (#1216) - expression matrix: named
; cells, context pq, value set A, 3 cells
; BUG(orig) (#1216): an operand is typed by the type so far and its
; place in the chain, not by its own type and the wanted type.
; Correct: the source compiles and each cell has the value of the decided rule
; (EM_RULES_DECIDED, tools/lib/exprmatrix/model.c); the original refuses a cell of
; it (Illegal Operator for Type), so nothing runs: the declared deviations.
; cells: pq-and-cl-cf-A pq-or-cl-cf-A pq-eor-cl-cf-A
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .q gq
Statement pq{x.q}
  SHARED gq
  gq=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  pq{100000 AND 1.5} : !CheckEq{Peek.l(&gq),$00000000,"pq-and-cl-cf-A"}
  pq{100000 OR 1.5} : !CheckEq{Peek.l(&gq),$86A10000,"pq-or-cl-cf-A"}
  pq{100000 EOR 1.5} : !CheckEq{Peek.l(&gq),$86A10000,"pq-eor-cl-cf-A"}
!EndTestCase
